1.8:
    - Added more fat32 specific commands (C drive) [EVERY COMMAND EXCEPT rm/del CRASH THE OS CURRENTLY, IM WORKING ON FIXING THAT]
        - cre.file (create file) "name"
        - cre.dir (create directory) "dir"
        - cp "src" "dest"
        - mv "src" "dest"
        - rm/del "file"
    - Added memset and memcpy functions to string.h because it causes problems with the new fat32 commands and extern "C"
    - Made KERNEL_PANIC only clear screen if cls argument is 1 (cause bools dont work xD)
        - Updated every KERNEL_PANIC call to also have the cls set
    - Fixed a bug that caused a stack overflow in FAT32 driver
    - Added version_naming_scheme.txt describing the future naming scheme for versions!
        - Version 1.8 is the last version using the normal Major.Minor naming scheme!
        - Future versions will be added here as Major.Minor but theire files are named differently!

